  "no_further_issues_reason": "No new defect. Covered: the full output diff against f707560 and main (only the two privacy pages and the two Ratametsuri pages differ from main; privacy pages byte-identical to the reviewed f707560 build); /ratametsuri/ and /en/ratametsuri/ at 390 and 1440 px, light and dark, in fi-FI and en-GB, with the counter absent, blocked, 3 s slow and loaded (stubbed, no visit sent): pixel-identical renders, unchanged CLS, no overflow, no page error, FCP unaffected; frame strips for the late counter and for both language switches with the counter blocked. Considered and not filed: defer holds DOMContentLoaded/load until a slow counter answers (async would not hold DOMContentLoaded), but nothing on the page waits on either event, so no visitor sees a difference. F1-F3 are the known pre-existing items, carried over.",
